{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-banai",
  "id": "source-21190",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "21190001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "聊聊关于「手办」这件事",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190002",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "嗨多磨，今天想跟大家聊聊「手办」这件事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190003",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "大家！成长的过程中一定有自己喜欢的玩具吧！比如生日时收到的玩偶，或者和朋友们每天拿来战斗玩耍的塑料小人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190004",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "孩童时期拿着它们玩扮家家酒的游戏时，有没有产生「要是它们动起来就好了」这样的想法呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190005",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "一定！一定有很多人这么想过吧？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190006",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "大家小时候曾经玩过的模型和玩具，现在会被放在哪里呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190007",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "现在如果再次看到它们，会不会像触电一样，遗忘的回忆和心情在这瞬间突然苏醒？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "21190008",
          "sourceType": 15,
          "speaker": "<color=#ED839F>Kizuna AI</color>",
          "text": "没有错，也许「手办」就是有着与那些记忆再次相遇的力量吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
